message: "If you use this TITAN release, please cite the associated manuscript and this versioned software archive."
type: software
title: "A Stabilized Boundary-Integral Poisson-Boltzmann Solver for Biomolecular Solvation Electrostatics"
version: "titan-bie-pb-v0.5"
date-released: "2026-08-14"
