abstract: "This manuscript-associated TITAN release provides the hardened analytical patch-ray solvent-excluded-surface implementation, an end-to-end biomolecular Poisson-Boltzmann workflow, and sparse near-field block ILU(0) stabilization for coupled boundary-integral solves. It includes source code, build instructions, five-system preconditioner validation data, PBE and MM/PBSA examples, and reference outputs."
keywords:
  - Poisson-Boltzmann
  - boundary integral equation
  - fast multipole method
  - biomolecular electrostatics
  - solvation free energy
  - MM/PBSA
  - ILU(0)
